@LeagueId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Seasons of a league (take the id from GET /leagues; defaults: newest first, offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons
Accept: application/json

### Page through the list
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?offset=0&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Second page (follow links.next from the previous response)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?offset=2&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Oldest first
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?sort=startYear
Accept: application/json

### One season by start year
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?startYear=2024
Accept: application/json

### Only the latest season of the league
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?current=true
Accept: application/json

### Filters, sort and paging together
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?startYear=2024&sort=-startYear&offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Offset beyond the end: 200 with empty items, not an error
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?offset=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: the league does not exist (404, unlike GET /seasons?leagueId= which returns an empty list)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/seasons
Accept: application/json

### Error: the league id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/not-a-guid/seasons
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?sort=name
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit out of range (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?limit=0
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?limit=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: negative offset (400, errors.offset)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{LeagueId}}/seasons?offset=-1
Accept: application/json
